        youtube: "",
        principle: "Nvidia out-executed rival 3dfx into bankruptcy, won the Xbox contract out from under a rival start-up, and went public in 1999, even as tension between Jensen's collective 'we' culture and cofounder Curtis Priem's possessive 'my architecture' instincts pushed Priem out of engineering and eventually out of the company.",
